<ul><li><b>Allyl-LG: {{SN1}}, yes.</b> The allyl cation is stabilized by resonance. The positive charge is shared between the two end carbons.</li><li><b>Vinyl-LG: no {{SN1}}.</b> A positive charge on a double-bond carbon is very unstable.</li></ul>
